        <P90>Has_Free_Acid_Or_Base_Form</P90>
        <P97>An association that connects the salt form of a drug with its free acid or free base.</P97>
        <P98>The free acid or base is responsible for the drug&apos;s therapeutic effect. Hence, the salt form of a drug has the same mechanism of action as the free acid or base form.</P98>
        <rdfs:label>Has_Free_Acid_Or_Base_Form</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#anyURI"/>
