        <P90>OLD_SOURCE_ROLE</P90>
        <P97>A property used to temporarily store the name and value of asserted restrictions present at the time a concept is premerged or preretired, where the filler value of the restriction is the concept being retired. Values stored in this property are restored as restrictions on properties on the source concept if the merge or retire is rejected.</P97>
