        <P108>Relationship_to_Target</P108>
        <P90>Relationship_to_Target</P90>
        <P97>A property representing the relationship of the NCI Thesaurus (NCIt) concept to the term from the outside source. There are four possibilities: 1) Has Synonym: the two terms are synonymous; 2) Broader Than: the NCIt concept is broader than the mapped (target) term; 3) Narrower Than: the NCIt concept is narrower than the mapped (target) term; 4) Related To: the NCIt concept is somehow related to the mapped (target) term.</P97>
        <required rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</required>
        <rdfs:label>Relationship_to_Target</rdfs:label>
