        <P107>Has Abnormal Cell</P107>
        <P108>Disease_Has_Abnormal_Cell</P108>
        <P90>Disease_Has_Abnormal_Cell</P90>
        <P97>A role used to relate a disease to the type of neoplastic cell present in and characteristic of the disease. The domain and the range for this role are &apos;Disease, Disorder or Finding&apos; and &apos;Abnormal Cell&apos;, respectively.</P97>
        <rdfs:label>Disease_Has_Abnormal_Cell</rdfs:label>
    </owl:ObjectProperty>
