        <NHC0>R106</NHC0>
        <P106>Conceptual Entity</P106>
        <P107>Has Molecular Abnormality</P107>
        <P108>Disease_Has_Molecular_Abnormality</P108>
        <P90>Disease_Has_Molecular_Abnormality</P90>
        <P97>A role used to relate a disease to a molecular abnormality that is present in the specified disease state. The domain and the range for this role are &apos;Disease, Disorder or Finding&apos; and &apos;Molecular Abnormality&apos;, respectively.</P97>
        <rdfs:label>Disease_Has_Molecular_Abnormality</rdfs:label>
    </owl:ObjectProperty>
