        <P97>A role used to imply the interaction or binding of an active ingredient of a drug/chemical agent at the molecular level with its target. When possible, the role value should reflect the direct alteration of function of a target molecule or complex. The domain and range for this role are &apos;Drug, Food, Chemical or Biomedical Material&apos; and &apos;Biological Process&apos;, respectively.</P97>
