        <P97>A role used to establish a link between a gene and the genetic or molecular abnormalities that have been observed in human cells and tissues associated with cancers (e.g., over- or under-expressed, amplified, translocated). The domain and range for this role are &apos;Gene&apos; and &apos;Molecular Abnormality&apos;, respectively.</P97>
        <rdfs:label>Gene_Has_Abnormality</rdfs:label>
