        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://ncicb.nci.nih.gov/xml/owl/EVS/Thesaurus.owl#P97"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget>A role used to link a gene with its physical extent on a chromosome, denoted by the chromosome number and start and end base positions (with numbering beginning at the telomere of the short p arm). The domain and range for this role are &apos;Gene&apos; and &apos;Anatomic Structure, System, or Substance&apos;, respectively.</owl:annotatedTarget>
