        <owl:annotatedTarget>A role used to establish the relationship between a therapeutic agent and an abnormal cell type associated with a disease condition. By pointing to abnormal cells, the therapeutic target of a drug can be more clearly conveyed. The domain and range for this role are &apos;Drug, Food, Chemical or Biomedical Material&apos; and &apos;Abnormal Cell&apos;, respectively.</owl:annotatedTarget>
