        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://ncicb.nci.nih.gov/xml/owl/EVS/Thesaurus.owl#P97"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget>A role used for an allele whose location has changed from the wild-type gene chromosomal location. This role is used to assert a new location that differs from the wild-type gene chromosomal location. The domain and range for this role are &apos;Gene&apos; and &apos;Anatomic Structure, System, or Substance&apos;, respectively.</owl:annotatedTarget>
