    <owl:ObjectProperty rdf:about="http://ncicb.nci.nih.gov/xml/owl/EVS/Thesaurus.owl#R159">
        <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="http://ncicb.nci.nih.gov/xml/owl/EVS/Thesaurus.owl#C16612"/>
        <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://ncicb.nci.nih.gov/xml/owl/EVS/Thesaurus.owl#C20189"/>
        <NHC0>R159</NHC0>
        <P106>Conceptual Entity</P106>
        <P107>Has Activity</P107>
        <P108>Allele_Has_Activity</P108>
        <P90>Allele_Has_Activity</P90>
        <P97>A role used to assert the observed level of activity associated with an allele in a given biological process, compared to the wild-type gene. The domain and range for this role are &apos;Gene&apos; and &apos;Property or Attribute&apos;, respectively.</P97>
        <rdfs:label>Allele_Has_Activity</rdfs:label>
