        <P97>A role used to assert a direct relationship between a disease, disorder or finding and a gene. This restriction can be used when a polymorphism or an abnormality in a gene is either a clinical marker for, a causative event for, or predisposes a subject to a disease. The domain and range for this role are &apos;Disease, Disorder or Finding&apos; and &apos;Gene&apos;, respectively.</P97>
