        <P97>A role used to indicate that molecular abnormalities in a gene may be associated with the manifestation of a disease. The role is used to assert a link between a gene and a disease when the association is considered to have clinical relevance. The domain and range for this role are &apos;Gene&apos; and &apos;Disease, Disorder or Finding&apos;, respectively.</P97>
        <rdfs:label>Gene_Associated_With_Disease</rdfs:label>
