        <P97>A role used to assert that expression or alteration of a gene is correlated with a particular disease or disease state or is predictive of the disease or disease state. The domain and range for this role are &apos;Gene&apos; and Findings_and_Disorder_Kind, respectively.</P97>
        <rdfs:label>Gene_Is_Biomarker_Of</rdfs:label>
