        <P97>A role used to assert a relationship between a gene and its general location, specified by chromosomal band position (infrequently by chromosome number or chromosome arm). The domain and range for this role are &apos;Gene&apos; and &apos;Anatomic Structure, System, or Substance&apos;, respectively.</P97>
        <rdfs:label>Gene_In_Chromosomal_Location</rdfs:label>
