        <P97>A role used to specify the physical structure type of a protein molecule (e.g. metalloprotein, transmembrane protein). Both the domain and range for this role are &apos;Gene Product&apos;.</P97>
        <P98>The role was originally intended for protein structure tagging (e.g., Phosphoprotein, Lipoprotein).  Was extended to also tag for Membrane Protein, Protein Complex Subunit, etc.</P98>
