        <P90>Organ</P90>
        <P90>Organs</P90>
        <P90>organ</P90>
        <P97>A unique macroscopic (gross) anatomic structure that performs specific functions. It is composed of various tissues.  An organ is part of an anatomic system or a body region. Representative examples include the heart, lung, liver, spleen, and uterus.</P97>
