        <P322>ICH</P322>
        <P325>A product that is added to the diet. A dietary supplement is taken by mouth, and usually contains one or more dietary ingredient (such as vitamin, mineral, herb, amino acid, and enzyme).</P325>
        <P325>Preparations containing ingredient(s) intended to supplement the diet.</P325>
        <P366>Nutritional_Supplement</P366>
        <P368>CHEBI:50733</P368>
        <P90>DIETARY SUPPLEMENT</P90>
        <P90>Dietary Supplement</P90>
        <P90>Dietary Supplements</P90>
