        <P90>risk_factors</P90>
        <P97>Any aspect of an individual&apos;s life, behavior, an environmental exposure, or an inborn or inherited characteristic that increases the likelihood of a disease, condition or injury.</P97>
        <rdfs:label>Risk Factor</rdfs:label>
