        <P325>A measureable characteristic that is influenced or affected by an individual&apos;s baseline state or an intervention, as in a clinical trial or other exposure. NOTE: Outcome can be a result of analysis and is more general than endpoint in that it does not necessarily relate to a planned objective of the study outcome (SDTM). [After BEST Resource] See also variable, observation.</P325>
