        <P90>Lupus Erythematosus Cell</P90>
        <P97>The lupus erythematosus cell, which is likely a neutrophil with denatured nuclei. It may be found in blood, bone marrow, synovial fluid, cerebrospinal fluid, pericardial and pleural effusions of individuals with lupus erythematosus.</P97>
